{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":72500,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793438413805,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2017,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vRYZA8DMB0pngHdaUHf6pkQNlBr.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1331403","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the popularity of \"action heroines\", many districts have had local heroines of their own, complete with live action hero shows. In Hinano City, Mikan Kise takes her younger sister Yuzuka to a hero show of the most popular local heroine, Kamidaio, only to discover the show had been cancelled at the last minute.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dUIC9L4EUMJr8wihPtMMI6KrGid.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dUIC9L4EUMJr8wihPtMMI6KrGid.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72500/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1352303","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After managing to recruit both Ann and Mikan to join the project, Misaki, who is working to erase Hinano's debt within six months, puts up a poster for more applicants, attracting costume designer Mana Midorikawa and technician Genki Aoyama.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3OdCweVjTqfHwobnFlnMlKsPNuD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3OdCweVjTqfHwobnFlnMlKsPNuD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72500/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1352302","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the girls find themselves needing a new place to practise, they are approached by a rhythmic gymnast from another school named Kanon Shimura, who is baffled to find Ann had quit rhythmic gymnastics to watch tokusatsu shows.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fl3B26860gZcJRjDTyQftIFVbEs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fl3B26860gZcJRjDTyQftIFVbEs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72500/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1352301","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Following Kamidaio's copyright claim, the girls are tasked with coming up with an original local heroine that shows off Hinano's appeal. As each girl presents their own ideas for a concept, Mikan proposes that they promote the city's fruits, deciding on the team name Cheer Fruits.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55etMUn4OgYAPqaiiC4PJ9M0A4T.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55etMUn4OgYAPqaiiC4PJ9M0A4T.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72500/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1352300","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The girls approach Yuki about joining Cheer Fruits, but she gets scared off by her own paranoia over quitting the idol business.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9PpMHfLcyeEsAV7UH0ibS4mz8po.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9PpMHfLcyeEsAV7UH0ibS4mz8po.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"ht